WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Tell Luster about your business, hours, services, prices and appointment lengths.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
Describe the look you want, or attach your design.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.200
AI creates and validates an editable website using saved business details.
The generation wait is shortened in this recording.

00:18.200 --> 00:22.200
Ask for a change in chat. Here, the owner asks for clearer phone navigation.

00:22.200 --> 00:24.700
Preview the actual revised website on desktop.

00:24.700 --> 00:27.200
The same saved design adapts to a phone.

00:27.200 --> 00:33.200
“Keep the design, but change BIAB to $70.”
Luster updates the service draft, not just website text.

00:33.200 --> 00:43.333
Review the exact proposed changes, then approve and publish.
Only the owner can do this.

00:43.333 --> 00:56.333
A customer chooses a service and an available time through Luster’s original booking flow.

00:56.333 --> 00:59.333
Confirmed: BIAB, CAD70, 75 minutes.
This is a real synthetic appointment in the isolated test environment.
